  m_text: "A Republican candidate with a background in political operations, Zach
    Lahn, has announced his run for Iowa governor, presenting himself as a Washington
    outsider. His campaign highlights his identity as a \u201Cfather, farmer, and
    businessman,\u201D emphasizing his roots as a sixth-generation Iowan and underscoring
    his independence from large corporations and special interests."
